      "id": "a4939af01f79ab88",
      "title": "Show HN: FERNme – agent memory that updates with ~zero LLM calls",
      "source": "Hacker News (AI 关键词)",
      "category": "A",
      "url": "https://github.com/mirkofr/FERNme",
      "published_raw": "Sat, 20 Jun 2026 23:34:03 +0000",
      "published_parsed": [
        2026,
        6,
        20,
        23,
        34,
        3,
        5,
        171,
        0
      ],
      "raw_text": "<p>Hi<p>I have been working on persistent memory. I wanted to see whether a brain like graph-based memory system could be used and more importantly how much we could save on llm tokens. FERNme uses fuzzy edge with Hebbian co-occurrence rule to create memory tags. I think FERNme could become a great personal memory of people that can be used by agents to give more personalized answers. The code is placed in: <a href=\"https://github.com/mirkofr/FERNme\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/mirkofr/FERNme</a><p>I invite developers to to check and test it and give honest criticism to make FERNme a real personal brain.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48614107\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48614107</a></p>\n<p>Points: 3</p>\n<p># Comments: 0</p>",
      "published_at": "2026-06-21T07:34:03+08:00",
      "keep": true,
      "scores": {
        "source_authority_score": 40,
        "freshness_score": 85,
        "ai_relevance_score": 75,
        "product_relevance_score": 50,
        "technical_impact_score": 55,
        "community_heat_score": 20
      },
      "final_score": 56,
      "summary_zh": "FERNme是一个基于图结构的Agent持久化记忆系统，采用模糊边+Hebbian共现规则构建记忆标签，声称几乎零LLM调用即可完成记忆更新，旨在为Agent提供低成本、个性化的长期用户记忆能力。",
      "why_zh": "大幅降低Agent记忆维护的token消耗，对构建低成本个性化Agent有工程价值。",
      "tags": [
        "Agent",
        "Open Source"
      ]
    }
  ],
